WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.980
Tsubasa-san?

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.720
That's...

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.640
Right on time, Finé.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:15.820
Finé?

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.080
The name which signifies the end is 
the symbol of our organization,

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.830
and also her second name.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.080
No way... Then she's...

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:30.290
The newly awakened second coming of Finé!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:16.360
<b>Episode 4 
The Place I Call Home</b>

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.760
In other words, the name 
"Finé" doesn't come from

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.120
the fact that they use heretical technology.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.520
Finé has revived,

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:26.870
and is leading their organization.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:30.060
Once again, a ghost of the precursor civilization

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.940
stands against those of us who live today?

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.620
We must fight once more,

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.310
Ryouko-kun?

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.770
No way...

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.900
Because Ryouko-san was...

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.280
Believe in the song in your heart.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.300
Reincarnation.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:19.070
A system of rebirth, which uses 
those who bear Finé's mark

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:23.400
within their genes, as a vessel, 
to exist in an eternal moment!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.590
No...

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.620
Then Maria-san, the artist...

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.060
Well...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.480
That is something I would like to know myself.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.500
<i>I was lucky to be able to defend the Nephilim...</i>

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.070
<i>But I am unsure of the appropriate 
next move for this board.</i>

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.340
Don't underestimate me!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.470
<b>Azure Flash</b>

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.680
I'm doing no such thing!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:43.090
<i>Kort el fes Gungnir! Kort el fes Gungnir!</i>

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:41.590
And that's why I shall fight you with my full power!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:05:00.650
<i>The fire of conviction dwells within my breast,</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:06.780
<i>an eternal blaze that no one can extinguish.</i>

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:12.560
<i>Even if my body burns to ash...</i>

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:19.380
<i>For the path that I believe in, 
I shall become one with Heaven.</i>

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:23.380
<i>On nights when I'm lost within the darkness,</i>

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.760
<i>shall I bring light with a song?</i>

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:29.140
<i>A serenade of holy light.</i>

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.890
<i>May power dwell within me...</i>

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:42.400
<i>A dream I'll never give up on howls.</i>

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:48.520
<i>For the sake of justice, pierce through darkness.</i>

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.900
Damage report.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:46.580
Hull damaged.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.410
At this rate, we won't be able to submerge.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:54.590
<i>An invincible blade, with no need for tears.</i>

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:53.190
Tsubasa! Get Maria off the boat!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>If you're ready to face me now, 
then make a vow to your pride!</i>

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.390
This is my chance.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.390
Hell, no!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.230
My turn!

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.080
What is she doing?

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.240
That first hit is affecting her.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.160
Then it's time for a white knight to save the day!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.500
<i>I think it's about time here, too.</i>

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.030
Go, Igalima!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:04.880
<i>Death 13, a dream of despair, 
bringing down the Grim Reaper.</i>

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:07.800
<i>An elegy sharper than a requiem.</i>

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.650
<i>Welcome to terror!</i>

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.480
<i>An absurd future.</i>

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.160
<i>I shouted, but really, I couldn't forgive myself.</i>

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:23.000
<i>If I reap everything and pile it all up, 
will it change into tomorrow?</i>

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.670
<b>Emergency Type Sigma Forbidden Moon Wheel</b>

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.670
<i>What you just saw now...</i>

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:29.670
<i>I'll carve you up before you can even feel pain!</i>

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:35.130
<i>I believe true strength is</i>

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:39.350
<i>when we're connected and believe in one another.</i>

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.310
Chris-chan!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.670
<i>As I take your hand...</i>

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.060
Are you okay, Chris-chan?

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.440
You made it back, right on time.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.490
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.540
And you saved me.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:49.160
<i>I'm sure it's still okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:51.320
<i>In fact, I don't think we've 
actually had enough fun.</i>

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.190
<i>These bonds shone brightly.</i>

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.390
I didn't save you for your sake.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:58.620
<i>Now let's sing a melody into the sky!</i>

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.580
Harsh.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.100
Damn it...

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:02.720
That compatibility drop means 
I can barely move...

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.410
But where did they come from?

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:09.020
Are there ambushers?

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.620
Scan every inch of the combat zone!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.500
I'm doing it, but...

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.900
It looks like the aufwachen waveforms 
and any other signals

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.730
were jammed until the wielders appeared!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.400
They have heretical technology we don't.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.540
<i>She matched my strike...</i>

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.420
<i>This blade is very unfeminine.</i>

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.820
<i>It's taking time, but my Gear's 
output is rising back up.</i>

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:52.550
<i>Can I do this?</i>

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.050
<i>My Gear is so heavy...</i>

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.470
Your compatibility values are dropping.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.730
We've recovered the Nephilim. Come back.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.650
This is all we can do within the time limit?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.160
No way.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.460
Is she using the same LiNKER as Kanade?

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:33.260
What are you trying to do?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.760
Protect the things that justice cannot protect.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.220
Return the Staff of Solomon, damn it!

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.270
What?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.600
Chris-chan?

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:32.610
Signal lost...

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.110
Supernatural stealth technology.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:40.610
Is this more heretical technology?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:56.010
<b>Shenshoujin</b>

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:52.500
<i>The stealth technology we gained through 
analysis of the Shenshoujin's functions...</i>

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.010
<i>Our advantage is large,</i>

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.650
<i>but extremely fragile.</i>

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.470
I must hurry...

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:09.610
There are other fragile things.

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:17.500
You screwed up!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.180
If they find our hideout,

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.410
where are we supposed to hide 
ourselves until the plan starts?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.010
Stop it.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:28.160
This will change nothing.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.150
It's bugging me!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.430
I was surprised.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.480
She didn't even give me a chance to apologize.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.860
Fortunately, we were able to protect our prize.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:43.990
But since they've found our base,

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:46.380
we can't feed the Nephilim.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.850
That's a serious problem.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.290
Even if it's quiet now,

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:54.980
we don't know when it will be hungry 
and go on another rampage.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.650
We lost the food we brought with us,

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.070
but we haven't lost everything.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.260
Are you guys okay?

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.220
Master...

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.820
I thought, even if Ryouko-san

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.110
and I didn't totally understand each other,

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.900
we'd connected on some level, at least.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:26.780
But...

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.350
If you haven't connected, 
keep slamming into her until you do!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.360
You, of all people, know

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.600
there are things stronger than words!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:37.580
I don't understand what you're saying at all.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.150
But I'll try!

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:50.540
Then the terrorist group calling themselves Finé

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:55.290
is composed of former American 
government researchers?

00:12:56.280 --> 00:13:00.290
Its formal name is the FIS,

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.050
the Federal Institutes of Sacrist.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:06.590
Supposedly, some of its staff left
 to form a paramilitary organization.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:13.540
Dr. Ver, who vanished along with the 
Staff of Solomon, only to reappear,

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.310
was also an FIS researcher.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:19.590
This is just a rumor,

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:23.720
but I'm told the FIS existed before 
the Japanese government

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.740
went public with the relics.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:29.250
In other words, the one responsible for its creation

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.060
was Finé, the woman who was 
working with the Americans?

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.750
That's why they

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.080
named themselves "Finé," perhaps.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:47.960
But the way they've acted doesn't 
feel right for a terrorist group.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:53.640
They may have planned this more 
carefully than it appears.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.420
<b>Fall Cherry Blossom Fair</b>

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.190
Hibiki!

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:17.410
Miku, what's wrong?

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.850
What do you mean "what's wrong"?

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.550
Itaba-san and everyone's performance 
is about to start!

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.260
Is it already that time?

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.190
Let's go. I'm sure it'll be fun.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.020
Yeah. Thanks, Miku.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:58.580
Now, up next, we have a trio 
from the first-year students!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.710
If they win, they'll get one wish

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.170
that the student council has the power to grant.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.270
What will they wish for?

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:11.710
Naturally, the establishment 
of an anime song club!

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:16.060
My ambitions and legends will all begin there!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.780
That's great.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.300
She's completely in character.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.440
At this point, I don't even care...

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.440
Okay, let's have them sing!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:29.190
The theme song of the TV anime 
<i>Lightning Detective Van</i>,

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:28.440
Looks like it's just starting.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.190
Yeah.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.960
"The Lightning Detective Arrives."

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.680
Carrying the sadness of those

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.850
who weep beneath the shining sun,

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:38.620
he comes to defeat evil!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.790
Howl... Lightning Detective arrives!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.790
<b>Lightning Detective Van</b>

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.460
<i>We got a call for help from you,</i>

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.720
<i>and we're making an emergency run.</i>

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.470
<i>Electricity runs down my chest,</i>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.970
<i>and I'm getting goosebumps!</i>

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.220
<i>There'll be more than just a warning shot.</i>

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.480
<i>Bang-bang Blaster!</i>

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.560
<i>I won't let the suspect escape.</i>

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.730
<i>Shuriken Handcuffs!</i>

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.980
<i>A detective's intuition breaks down your alibi.</i>

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:11.240
<i>I work for the whole Earth!</i>

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:16.540
We haven't even sung the full chorus yet...

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.890
The second verse's lyrics will make you cry!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.750
Why?!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.040
<i>I really do want Hibiki to laugh 
like she always does...</i>

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.620
<i>That's who I think she really is.</i>

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.180
This is fun, isn't it?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.510
Everything tastes so good!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.560
Stare.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.950
What is it, Shirabe?

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.250
Our mission isn't

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:50.010
to enjoy the school fair, Kiri-chan.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.880
I-I know that.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:55.200
This is part of our investigation!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.280
Investigation?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.860
Everyone is drawn to delicious food.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:05.070
By completing a map of the school's good food,

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:08.170
<b>Good Food Map</b>

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:08.170
we can narrow down our list of targets.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.860
Don't worry. It'll be fine.

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:20.310
I haven't forgotten my task, even for a second.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.560
It's a fact that when we lost our hideout,

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:26.690
the food we need for the Nephilim's growth,

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.110
the relic fragments,

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.950
was taken by Section 2.

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:36.630
But we only had a few left that 
we brought from home.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.580
We were going to need more soon, anyway.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.510
If you knew that,

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:45.460
then you've already devised a plan?

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.860
Calling it a "plan" is overstating it...

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:53.130
These days,

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.340
there are relic fragments everywhere.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.850
You can't mean to feed it these pendants.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.470
Of course not!

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:07.230
We can't lose the Gears that comprise a 
significant part of our combat strength.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:11.130
Then I'll take their Symphogears.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.610
You can't do that!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.490
No.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.680
Each time you use your power,

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.540
Finé's soul awakens more.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.000
That means she's erasing your own soul.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.500
That cannot happen.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.870
You two...

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:34.680
Then what will you do?

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.640
We'll do it.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.260
Protecting Maria is our fight!

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:44.520
Or so I said...

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.790
But what do we do?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.660
Kiri-chan, she's right over there.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.280
We don't have a plan, 
and I'm not ready, either.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.190
It's too soon!

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:13.770
There's no way we can just grab her 
pendant without her noticing.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.380
Then we'll take it by force.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:23.760
Ow...

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.740
Again, Yukine?

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.730
What's the hurry?

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.360
They're chasing me!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.150
They're narrowing their cordon, little by little.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.270
You noticed it, as well, Yukine?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:40.530
I just felt like someone was watching me.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.430
They noticed us?

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.390
We found you, Yukine-san!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.320
Please... There's no time before it starts!

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:59.840
Now, here's our next challenger!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.690
Hibiki, is that...

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.050
No way!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.540
It's Yukine.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.260
Yukine Chris, second-year student

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.660
at Lydian Music Academy.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.040
Chris-chan...

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:35.040
You can do it!

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:40.300
<i>When someone offered me their hand,</i>

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:44.800
<i>I learned about a different type of pain.</i>

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:50.160
<i>The picture I'd drawn of my future was monochrome,</i>

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.810
<i>and I'm looking for the paints!</i>

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.910
I know it's the middle of the semester, 
but I'll introduce your new classmate.

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:58.770
<i>But now, why? Why?</i>

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.780
I'm Y-Yukine Chris...

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.780
<i>It's slowly turning brilliant colors,</i>

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:05.910
<i>like a flower blooming, boasting of its rainbow.</i>

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:02.860
Yukine-san!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.860
Want to eat with us?

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:06.280
S-Sorry.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:14.000
<i>A wind blows through the halls, 
mixing with the after school chimes.</i>

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:07.860
I'm busy.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:23.690
<i>I'm still unsure of how to deal with this sense 
of belonging that I've never felt before.</i>

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:34.150
<i>I can't hide my smile, as I look up at the clear sky!</i>

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:32.560
What's going on?

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:36.060
We want Yukine to perform in 
the singing competition.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.980
Why would I?

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.940
Because when you sing, you look
 like you're having so much fun.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:46.990
<i>Is it okay for me to smile?</i>

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:51.740
<i>Will they forgive me?</i>

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:58.670
<i>Is okay for me to sing as hard, 
as hard as I possibly can,</i>

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:06.050
<i>from the bottom of my heart, as true 
to myself as I can possibly be?</i>

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:02.760
Do you not like to sing?

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:05.730
I...

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:14.350
<i>The sunlight, shining into the 
classroom, was so bright.</i>

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:23.910
<i>Like melting snow, for some reason, 
tears welled up and wouldn't stop.</i>

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:29.010
<i>It's so warm, so warm...</i>

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:33.310
<i>The place I call home.</i>

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:41.060
<i>The place I call home.</i>

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:42.780
<i>This is fun...</i>

00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:46.520
<i>I didn't know I could have so much fun singing.</i>

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:50.250
<i>Oh...</i>

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:54.400
<i>This must be</i>

00:22:55.260 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>a place</i>

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>where I can belong!</i>

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:17.090
We have a new singing competition champion!

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:19.500
Who'll be our next challenger?

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:22.000
No need to register!

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:23.540
We'll do it!

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:30.550
Those are...

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:35.730
We will challenge...

00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:37.430
...the champion!
